      "updated": 1785589517737,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "I have to decide how many tables I'm going to use and\nhow they should look like. this is the way i decide\nthe architecture of database.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "CW0n5cZA22DcjGqxL1rAX",
      "originalText": "I have to decide how many tables I'm going to use and how they should look like. this is the way i decide the architecture of database.",
