      "seed": 1687721794,
      "version": 667,
      "versionNonce": 656314718,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1785590399085,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "We have to add Schema alongside models.\n\nUser inculdes:\n1.ID\n2.Name\n3.Password\n\nFirst Table is Called Chats, it includes:\n1.ID\n2. User_ID\n3. Chat Name\n\nThen we will have user messages that include:\n1.ID\n2. User_ID\n3.Chat_ID\n4.Content\n\nThen we will have assistant messages that\ninclude:\n1.ID\n2.Model_Name\n3.Chat_ID\n4.Content",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "WHloLvhtodl-oGKKKTEEK",
      "originalText": "We have to add Schema alongside models.\n\nUser inculdes:\n1.ID\n2.Name\n3.Password\n\nFirst Table is Called Chats, it includes:\n1.ID\n2. User_ID\n3. Chat Name\n\nThen we will have user messages that include:\n1.ID\n2. User_ID\n3.Chat_ID\n4.Content\n\nThen we will have assistant messages that include:\n1.ID\n2.Model_Name\n3.Chat_ID\n4.Content",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
